---
const title = 'Zymplo · Brutalist Lab · V04';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#FAFB14" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Archivo+Black&family=Inter:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" />
    <style is:inline>
      :root { --paper: #FAFB14; --ink: #000; --turq: #14B8A6; --hot: #FF3D00; --good: #16A34A; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: hidden; }
      .grid-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(black 2px, transparent 2px), linear-gradient(90deg, black 2px, transparent 2px); background-size: 80px 80px; opacity: 0.06; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }

      .topbar { position: relative; z-index: 5; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 4px solid black; background: black; color: var(--paper); font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
      .topbar a { color: var(--paper); text-decoration: none; }
      .topbar .pulse { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--good); margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle; animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite; }
      @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

      .hero { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 60px 20px 100px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .meta-line { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 4px solid black; border-bottom: 4px solid black; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }

      h1 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(60px, 18vw, 280px); line-height: 0.82; letter-spacing: -0.06em; margin: 40px 0; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 .stamp { display: inline-block; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: 0 12px; transform: rotate(-1deg); }
      h1 .strike { text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-thickness: 8px; opacity: 0.6; }
      h1 .neg { display: inline-block; background: var(--turq); padding: 0 14px; transform: rotate(0.6deg); }

      .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; margin-top: 60px; border: 4px solid black; }
      @media (min-width: 900px) { .row { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; } }
      .row > * { padding: 28px; border-bottom: 4px solid black; }
      .row > *:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
      @media (min-width: 900px) { .row > *:first-child { border-right: 4px solid black; border-bottom: 0; } }

      .lede { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 19px); line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; }
      .lede strong { background: var(--paper); display: inline; padding: 0 4px; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }
      .cta-block { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 280px; }
      .cta-block .label { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; opacity: 0.7; }
      .cta-block .cta { display: inline-block; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); padding: 22px 28px; font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); text-decoration: none; border: 4px solid var(--paper); transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s; align-self: stretch; text-align: center; line-height: 1; }
      .cta-block .cta:hover { transform: translate(-4px, -4px); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--turq); }
      .cta-block .micro { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.7; margin-top: 12px; }

      .stats-bar { margin-top: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); border: 4px solid black; border-top: 0; }
      @media (min-width: 700px) { .stats-bar { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
      .stats-bar .s { padding: 28px 20px; border-right: 4px solid black; border-bottom: 4px solid black; }
      @media (min-width: 700px) { .stats-bar .s { border-bottom: 0; } }
      .stats-bar .s:last-child { border-right: 0; }
      .stats-bar .s:nth-child(2n) { border-right: 0; }
      @media (min-width: 700px) { .stats-bar .s:nth-child(2n) { border-right: 4px solid black; } .stats-bar .s:last-child { border-right: 0; } }
      .stats-bar .v { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px); line-height: 0.9; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      .stats-bar .l { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-top: 8px; }
      .stats-bar .s.alt { background: var(--turq); }
      .stats-bar .s.alt2 { background: var(--hot); color: var(--paper); }

      .zigzag { padding: 80px 20px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .feat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; margin-bottom: -4px; }
      @media (min-width: 900px) { .feat { grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr; } }
      .feat { border: 4px solid black; }
      .feat .num { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 56px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px; }
      .feat .body { padding: 28px; }
      .feat .body h3 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); line-height: 0.95; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .feat .body p { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
      .feat:nth-child(2n) .num { background: var(--turq); color: var(--ink); }
      .feat:nth-child(3n) .num { background: var(--hot); color: var(--paper); }

      .marquee { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: 18px 0; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; border-top: 4px solid black; border-bottom: 4px solid black; }
      .marquee-track { display: inline-block; animation: scroll 30s linear infinite; font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 36px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      .marquee-track span { padding: 0 24px; }
      .marquee-track span:nth-child(2n) { color: var(--turq); }
      @keyframes scroll { from { transform: translateX(0); } to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

      .footer { padding: 40px 20px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; border-top: 4px solid black; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
      .footer a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; margin: 0 12px; }
      .footer a:first-child { margin-left: 0; }

      .lab-badge { position: fixed; top: 14px; right: 14px; z-index: 100; padding: 6px 12px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); border: 3px solid var(--ink); font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; }
      .nav-back { position: fixed; top: 14px; left: 14px; z-index: 100; padding: 6px 12px 6px 6px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); border: 3px solid var(--ink); font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
      .nav-back img { height: 16px; }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { animation: none !important; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="grid-bg"></div>

    <a class="nav-back" href="/lab/"><img src="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" alt="Zymplo" />← LAB</a>
    <a class="lab-badge" href="/lab/">04 · BRUTALIST</a>

    <div class="topbar">
      <span><span class="pulse"></span>EN VIVO · 13 PAÍSES · 3 IDIOMAS</span>
      <span>$ 47.28M COBRADOS HOY</span>
    </div>

    <main class="hero">
      <div class="meta-line">
        <span>VOL.01 · ED.05 · ZYMPLO/2026</span>
        <span>WHATSAPP NATIVE · NO APP · NO LOGIN</span>
      </div>

      <h1>
        <span class="strike">PERSEGUÍS</span>
        QUE
        <span class="stamp">PAGUEN</span>
        <br/>
        DEJÁS DE
        <br/>
        <span class="neg">PERDER</span> TIEMPO
      </h1>

      <div class="row">
        <div>
          <p class="lede">Zymplo es <strong>tu secretaria IA</strong> dentro de WhatsApp. Cobra · factura · agenda · organiza. Sin app · sin signup · sin fricción. Detecta facturas vencidas y manda recordatorios calientes que cobran. Te avisa cuando entró la plata. Vos seguís haciendo lo tuyo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-block">
          <div>
            <div class="label">EMPEZAR · 10 SEG</div>
          </div>
          <a class="cta" href="https://wa.me/595981970735?text=Quiero%20probar%20Zymplo">PROBAR →</a>
          <div class="micro">GRATIS PARA SIEMPRE · WHATSAPP · SIN LETRA CHICA</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-bar">
        <div class="s"><div class="v">$ 47M</div><div class="l">cobrados / mes</div></div>
        <div class="s alt"><div class="v">12.847</div><div class="l">activos hoy</div></div>
        <div class="s"><div class="v">13</div><div class="l">países LATAM+US</div></div>
        <div class="s alt2"><div class="v">847</div><div class="l">se sumaron hoy</div></div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <section class="zigzag">
      <div class="feat"><div class="num">01</div><div class="body"><h3>Cobra sin perseguir</h3><p>Detecta facturas vencidas. Manda recordatorios calientes que cobran. Te avisa cuando entró la plata. No más Excel · no más planillas.</p></div></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="num">02</div><div class="body"><h3>Facturá hablando</h3><p>"Hacé factura a Pablo por 850.000". Listo. NFS-e · CFDI · DIAN · AFIP · DGT. Lo que necesite tu país. Sin que lo aprendas vos.</p></div></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="num">03</div><div class="body"><h3>Agenda en tu cabeza</h3><p>"Recordame mañana 9 ir al taller". Llega el aviso a las 9. Punto. Reuniones · pagos · cumpleaños. Nunca más se te olvida nada.</p></div></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="num">04</div><div class="body"><h3>24/7 sin parar</h3><p>Zé no duerme · no se enferma · no se va de vacaciones. Trabaja por vos siempre. 13 países · 3 idiomas. Tu moneda · tus impuestos · tu jerga local.</p></div></div>
    </section>

    <div class="marquee">
      <div class="marquee-track">
        <span>★ COBRÁ SIN PERSEGUIR</span><span>★ FACTURÁ HABLANDO</span><span>★ AGENDA EN TU CABEZA</span><span>★ 13 PAÍSES</span><span>★ 24/7 SIN PARAR</span><span>★ GRATIS PARA SIEMPRE</span>
        <span>★ COBRÁ SIN PERSEGUIR</span><span>★ FACTURÁ HABLANDO</span><span>★ AGENDA EN TU CABEZA</span><span>★ 13 PAÍSES</span><span>★ 24/7 SIN PARAR</span><span>★ GRATIS PARA SIEMPRE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
      © 2026 ZYMPLO · BRUTALIST EDITION ·
      <a href="/lab/">LAB</a> · <a href="/">LANDING ACTUAL</a> · <a href="/lab/v05/">V05 EDITORIAL</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
